Author: matthewmcneill <97467074+matthewmcneill@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Tue Aug 11 09:05:08 2026 +0100

    fix(portal): design system remediation — colour tokens, monospace, icons, ARIA (#87)
    
    Eliminates all design system violations from the web portal audit.
    
    WO1 — Colour Token Migration (6 files):
    - Replace off-palette hex colours (#6c63ff, #999, #ccc, #ff8f00, #43a047)
      with semantic CSS custom properties (--primary, --text-muted, --border,
      --warning, --success)
    - Replace hard-coded #000 on theme-sensitive badges with var(--text)
    
    WO2 — CSS Monospace Font Stack (1 file):
    - Expand 'Courier New', monospace to full DS --font-mono stack (3 instances)
    
    WO3 — Icon Remediation (4 files):
    - Replace emoji-as-icons in keys.js with Feather SVGs (lock, link, trash-2)
    - Fix non-standard SVG sizing in auth.js and index.html
    
    WO4 — ARIA Tab Semantics (2 files):
    - Add role=tablist/tab/tabpanel to navigation
    - Dynamic aria-selected state management
    - Skip-to-content link for keyboard navigation
    
    Bugfix — Pill touch specificity:
    - .pill-btn:hover (0,2,0) was beating .pill-btn--active (0,1,0), causing
      blue-on-blue invisible text on touch screens where :hover is sticky.
      Adding .pill-btn--active:hover ensures the active state always wins.
    
    Tested: 419/419 native, Playwright web gate, CrowPanel build+flash verified.

